{"chapter": "stacks", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "02ZH", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$2$", "MATH_0002": "$2$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0004": "$(2, 1)$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:7131d2abc39ebb7482b0e4201932dce3ad48e79f871c5de4a6a3a7582f87b71f", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:da8c879520754aa442b7a406e90ec0b96208fc5f8ee88d220ad7c3728b5e515b", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nNote that any <MATH_0001>-morphism is automatically an isomorphism, so\nthat in fact the <MATH_0002>-category of stacks in groupoids over <MATH_0003>\nis a (strict) <MATH_0004>-category.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c7ea45ee4fcb46c9dee16755e5dcd5d1d14fcf078f03c7a0635b1cde4c6970fb", "unit_id": "tag:02ZH:prose-0004"}
{"chapter": "stacks", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02ZH", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$2$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{categories-lemma-2-product-categories-over-C}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-2-product-stacks-in-groupoids}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:a09c24ec2d25cd681716b94fac9200b9048bae113080f6001113641b30bad3cf", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7e1acecf0bb18a64e6014687d9cf9261e44d74489a7030b0b8c9f83c5f10573d", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a category.\nThe <MATH_0002>-category of stacks in groupoids over <MATH_0003>\nhas 2-fibre products, and they are described as in\nCategories, Lemma <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ea08f7a3029ed1a8c057f227daa5a2cdc2f2f90e341484b1f8689e9d41321f7d", "unit_id": "tag:02ZL:statement"}
